    <m:properties>
      <d:TechnicalName>FigafJiraIntegration</d:TechnicalName>
      <d:DisplayName>Figaf Jira Integration</d:DisplayName>
      <d:ShortText>The package provides bi-directional communication between Figaf and Jira. It includes highly configurable iFlows processing Figaf webhooks for ticket/transport events to Jira actions, update Figaf based on Jira changes, and a utility for searching issues.</d:ShortText>
      <d:reg_id>6b4ef2e935a84b9f847a3f93e3030969</d:reg_id>
      <d:Featured m:null="true"/>
      <d:Scope m:null="true"/>
      <d:Description>&lt;p&gt;The "Figaf Jira Integration" package provides a template for integrating Figaf and Jira. It includes highly configurable iFlows processing Figaf webhooks for ticket/transport events to Jira actions, update Figaf based on Jira changes, and a utility for searching issues.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Search Jira Issues&amp;nbsp; &lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Utility iFlow for fetching essential data about Jira issues from a specific project. &lt;br&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Update Jira Issues&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;br&gt; Allows Figaf DevOps events to change status and add comments to Jira issues. &lt;br&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Update Figaf Transport from Jira&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;br&gt; Allows Jira webhooks to trigger imports of Figaf Transports. &lt;br&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Download the required Proxy from this &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://workdrive.zohopublic.eu/external/108eb522babf927c1828c9df3d40c1a6cb2af9cfe16d0c72a2376c59b12654f1/download" rel="nofollow"&gt;download link&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;.&lt;em&gt; &lt;br&gt; &lt;br&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;p&gt;You can signup for a free trial at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href="https://figaf.com/figaf-devops-tool/" rel="nofollow"&gt;Figaf&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;you can get started in as little as 30 minutes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;The installation guide for the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href="https://help.figaf.com/portal/en/kb/articles/installation" rel="nofollow"&gt;Figaf Tool is here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</d:Description>
